  "summary": "Currently a St. Software Developer and OnBase System Administrator for STERIS Corporate Headquarters. Joining the I&T Team at STERIS in January of 2015 to support and administer their enterprise OnBase solution for Digital Content Management. Today I support 30+ OnBase Applications as a Primary from Solution Analysis to Design, Development, Support, and administration. As of November 2025, I’ve been re-certified in WF, WV and System Support and Troubleshooting receiving my Expert certificates. \n\nPrior to joining STERIS I&T, I was a part of Hyland Software's Technical team from 2008-2014.  I started in Quality Assurance as a software tester on the Web Services team and then with the Government Solutions team. I then transfered to Hyland's Technical Services Department as a Solution Engineer specialized in Government Implementations. I installed and configured OnBase's Government solutions for Hylamd's Government customers and Partners. I was primarily focused on OnBase's Electronic Plan Review, Integration for Esri ArcGIS and Azteca Cityworks, and Agenda Management. I also worked very closely with SIRE Technologies who was acquired by Hyland Software in 2013 and was considered a major player in the government space with their Agenda Solution. I left Hyland in September 2014.",
